td><img src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/media\\/b7\\/5f\\/85\\/1776168070\\/gems1.png?ts=1776168070\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" width=\\\"75\\\" height=\\\"auto\\\"\\/><\\/td>\\n                    <td>\\n                        \\n                        <div>\\n                            x100 Sapphire\\n                        <\\/div>\\n\\n                        \\n                                            <\\/td>\\n                    <td style=\\\"text-align: center\\\">1<\\/td>\\n                    <td>\\u20ac0.99<\\/td>\\n                    <td>\\u20ac0.99<\\/td>\\n                <\\/tr>\\n\\n                                                                                        <tr>\\n                    <td><\\/td>\\n                    <td><\\/td>\\n                    <td>\\n                        \\n                        <div>\\n                            Last days of April\\n                        <\\/div>\\n\\n                        \\n                                            <\\/td>\\n                    <td style=\\\"text-align: center\\\">1<\\/td>\\n                    <td>-\\u20ac0.05<\\/td>\\n                    <td>-\\u20ac0.05<\\/td>\\n                <\\/tr>\\n\\n                                        <\\/table>\\n\\n    \\n                    <p>\\n        <br>\\n        <br>\\n                    Shipping costs: \\u20ac0.00<br>\\n        \\n        Net total: \\u20ac0.79<br>\\n                    including 19% VAT. \\u20ac0.15<br>\\n                <strong>Total gross: \\u20ac0.94<\\/strong><br>\\n                <br>\\n\\n                    <strong>Selected payment type:<\\/strong> Cash on delivery<br>\\n            Payment upon receipt of goods.<br>\\n            <br>\\n        \\n                    <strong>Selected shipping type:<\\/strong> Standard<br>\\n            <br>\\n            <br>\\n        \\n                <strong>Billing address:<\\/strong><br>\\n        <br>\\n        Max Tester<br>\\n        Behringstr <br>\\n        02625 Bautzen<br>\\n        Germany<br>\\n        <br>\\n\\n                    <strong>Shipping address:<\\/strong><br>\\n            <br>\\n            Max Tester<br>\\n            Behringstr <br>\\n            02625 Bautzen<br>\\n            Germany<br>\\n            <br>\\n                        <br>\\n        You can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/vk6nLyvxvvS1o87m_caN1alA8xpAPSxr\\n        <br>\\n        If you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact us.\\n        <br>\\n            <\\/p>\\n    <br>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"text\\/plain\":\"Dear Mr. Max Tester,\\n\\nWe have received your order from 29 Apr 2026, 10:54.\\n\\nOrder number: 10000\\n\\nAs soon as your payment has been made, you will receive a separate notification and your order will be processed.\\n\\nYou may check the current status of your order with this link: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/vk6nLyvxvvS1o87m_caN1alA8xpAPSxr\\nYou may use this link to edit your order, change the payment method or make additional payments.\\n\\nInformation on your order:\\n\\nPos. 1\\n---------------------\\nProduct number SP00001,\\nDescription x100 Sapphire,\\nQuantity 1,\\nPrice \\u20ac0.99,\\nTotal \\u20ac0.99,\\n\\nPos. 2\\n---------------------\\nDescription Last days of April,\\nQuantity 1,\\nPrice -\\u20ac0.05,\\nTotal -\\u20ac0.05,\\n\\nShipping costs: \\u20ac0.00\\nNet total: \\u20ac0.79\\nincluding 19% VAT. \\u20ac0.15\\nTotal gross: \\u20ac0.94\\n\\nSelected payment type: Cash on delivery\\nPayment upon receipt of goods.\\n\\nSelected shipping type: Standard\\n\\nBilling address:\\n\\nMax Tester\\nBehringstr\\n02625 Bautzen\\nGermany\\n\\nShipping address:\\n\\nMax Tester\\nBehringstr\\n02625 Bautzen\\nGermany\\n\\nYou can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/acc