/>\\n\\n                    <strong>Shipping address:<\\/strong><br\\/>\\n            <br\\/>\\n            Max Tester<br\\/>\\n            Behringstr <br\\/>\\n            02625 Bautzen<br\\/>\\n            Germany<br\\/>\\n            <br\\/>\\n                        <br\\/>\\n        You can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/vk6nLyvxvvS1o87m_caN1alA8xpAPSxr\\n        However, in case you have purchased without a registration or a customer account, you do not have this option.\\n        <br\\/>\\n        If you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact us.\\n        <br\\/>\\n            <\\/p>\\n    <br\\/>\\n<\\/div>\",\"text\\/plain\":\"Dear Mr. Max Tester,\\n\\nWe have received your order on 29 Apr 2026, 10:54.\\n\\nOrder number: 10000.\\n\\nYou have not completed your payment with Cash on delivery yet. You can resume the payment process by using the following URL: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/vk6nLyvxvvS1o87m_caN1alA8xpAPSxr\\n\\nInformation on your order:\\n\\nPos. 1\\n---------------------\\nProduct number SP00001,\\nDescription x100 Sapphire,\\nQuantity 1,\\nPrice \\u20ac0.99,\\nTotal \\u20ac0.99,\\n\\nPos. 2\\n---------------------\\nDescription Last days of April,\\nQuantity 1,\\nPrice -\\u20ac0.05,\\nTotal -\\u20ac0.05,\\n\\nShipping costs: \\u20ac0.00\\nNet total: \\u20ac0.79\\nincluding 19% VAT. \\u20ac0.15\\nTotal gross: \\u20ac0.94\\n\\nSelected payment type: Cash on delivery\\nPayment upon receipt of goods.\\n\\nSelected shipping type: Standard\\n\\nBilling address:\\n\\nMax Tester\\nBehringstr\\n02625 Bautzen\\nGermany\\n\\nShipping address:\\n\\nMax Tester\\nBehringstr\\n02625 Bautzen\\nGermany\\n\\nYou can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/vk6nLyvxvvS1o87m_caN1alA8xpAPSxr\\nHowever, in c