ick Order City\\nGermany\\n\\nShipping address:\\n\\nQuick Order\\nQuick Order Street\\n00000 Quick Order City\\nGermany\\n\\nYou can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/sFNnzyloSuwIgzeqk64N6B2wlqFIzqQ-\\nIf you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact us.\\n\\n\"}}}','[]','2026-05-14 18:57:38.019',NULL),
