y questions, do not hesitate to contact us.\\n        <br>\\n            <\\/p>\\n    <br>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"text\\/plain\":\"Dear Mr. Quick Order,\\n\\nWe have received your order from 14 May 2026, 21:03.\\n\\nOrder number: 10003\\n\\nAs soon as your payment has been made, you will receive a separate notification and your order will be processed.\\n\\nYou may check the current status of your order with this link: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/NNNCWx7YIqewOhMjVbtW83B0z-4NVdZq\\nYou may use this link to edit your order, change the payment method or make additional payments.\\n\\nInformation on your order:\\n\\nPos. 1\\n---------------------\\nProduct number ST00002,\\nDescription x3 Crate with Sapphires,\\nQuantity 2,\\nPrice \\u20ac2.99,\\nTotal \\u20ac5.98,\\n\\nShipping costs: \\u20ac0.00\\nNet total: \\u20ac5.03\\nincluding 19% VAT. \\u20ac0.95\\nTotal gross: \\u20ac5.98\\n\\nSelected payment type: Cash on delivery\\nPayment upon receipt of goods.\\n\\nSelected shipping type: Standard\\n\\nBilling address:\\n\\nQuick Order\\nQuick Order Street\\n00000 Quick Order City\\nGermany\\n\\nShipping address:\\n\\nQuick Order\\nQuick Order Street\\n00000 Quick Order City\\nGermany\\n\\nYou can check the current status of your order on our website under \\\"My account\\\" - \\\"My orders\\\" anytime: http:\\/\\/localhost:8000\\/account\\/order\\/NNNCWx7YIqewOhMjVbtW83B0z-4NVdZq\\nIf you have any questions, do not hesitate to contact us.\\n\\n\"}}}','[]','2026-05-14 19:03:26.335',NULL),
